sequenceDiagram
  participant P as Parent (reporter)
  participant S as ShoMap
  participant N as Nearby users
  participant A as Police thana
  participant M as Admin
  P->>S: Report missing child (photo, last seen, clothing)
  S->>S: Urgency = Critical, create SOS alert (3 km, 72h)
  S->>N: Real-time SOS banner + notification
  S->>A: Immediate referral (critical)
  S->>M: Flag for review (fake-alert guard)
  N->>S: Sighting comment with location
  S->>P: Notify sighting
  A->>S: Acknowledge, in progress
  P->>S: Mark FOUND
  S->>N: Alert closed, photo hidden from public
